        "name": "速度解析拖影",
        "value": "L31: const qT = x => Math.round(x * FPS) / FPS, SH = 0.5 / FPS;；L607: const [R0, G0, B0] = hexRgb(col).map(v => Math.round(v * 255)), cs = a => `rgba(${R0},${G0},${B0},${a})`, ux = dx / L, uy = dy / L, T = L + 2 * r, am = Math.min(1, 2 * r / L), o1 = Math.min(2 * r, L) / T, an = Math.atan2(dy, dx);；L608: const gr = c.createLinearGradient(mx - ux * T / 2, my - uy * T / 2, mx + ux * T / 2, my + uy * T / 2);"
      },
